# Circuit line-ending + binary policy.
# The Windows lane has a burned trap: CRLF line endings once dropped an ESM import at load
# (regression-locked in test/regressions.test.js). Force LF on all text source so no editor or
# git core.autocrlf can ever reintroduce it — on any contributor's machine, Windows included.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending-normalized (that corrupts the file). The MSIX Store
# tiles are hand-encoded PNGs whose bytes legitimately contain 0x0d — mark them binary.
*.png binary
*.msix binary
*.exe binary
*.ico binary
